From 668aa1cd3cb80734d15c2c4c0e86613654be95a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bernhard=20Rosenkr=C3=A4nzer?= <bero@lindev.ch>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 18:23:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Bug 2054387 - media: enable VAAPI/DMABuf and WebRTC
 paths for Qt. r?#media-playback-reviewers,#webrtc-reviewers

Extend FFmpeg VAAPI, desktop capture, and related Linux media plumbing
so they build and run with MOZ_WIDGET_QT as well as GTK.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311742
